    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d776">

                <pb facs="0761" n="595" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg595"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 859d.00/4</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-08T16:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 8, 1915, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>185. It is understood that Danish socialists have financed Hamilton Jackson’s
                    uprising in the Danish West Indies. The present Government sends <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Valkyrian</hi> in order to prevent conservative
                    criticism that it does not offer protection to the whites. Sentiment in favor of
                    selling islands to the United States growing very fast.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Egan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
